---
const releaseBase = 'https://github.com/bunwright/wyrd-lang/releases/latest';
const downloadBase = `${releaseBase}/download`;

const artifacts = [
	{ system: 'macOS', arch: 'Apple Silicon', target: 'aarch64-apple-darwin', format: 'tar.gz', mark: '⌘' },
	{ system: 'macOS', arch: 'Intel', target: 'x86_64-apple-darwin', format: 'tar.gz', mark: '⌘' },
	{ system: 'Linux', arch: 'ARM64', target: 'aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu', format: 'tar.gz', mark: 'LX' },
	{ system: 'Linux', arch: 'x86–64', target: 'x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu', format: 'tar.gz', mark: 'LX' },
	{ system: 'Windows', arch: 'ARM64', target: 'aarch64-pc-windows-msvc', format: 'zip', mark: '⊞' },
	{ system: 'Windows', arch: 'x86–64', target: 'x86_64-pc-windows-msvc', format: 'zip', mark: '⊞' },
];
---

<section class="wyrd-downloads" id="nim-wyrd" aria-labelledby="downloads-heading">
	<div class="wyrd-downloads__head">
		<div>
			<p class="wyrd-overline">Frēolǣstung</p>
			<h2 id="downloads-heading">Wyrd nim. Nāne foregesette sprǣc.</h2>
		</div>
		<p>Ælc bōc is ān selfstandende fremmere. Unbind, fremme, and writ—Yanxu ne þearf on þīnum mǣċene geset bēon.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="wyrd-install-command">
		<div>
			<strong>macOS and Linux</strong>
			<small>Mǣċencynn āwrecen · SHA-256 gefandod · geset on ~/.local/bin</small>
		</div>
		<code>curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bunwright/wyrd-lang/main/install.sh | sh</code>
	</div>
	<div class="wyrd-download-grid">
		{artifacts.map((artifact) => (
			<a
				href={`${downloadBase}/wyrd-${artifact.target}.${artifact.format}`}
				aria-label={`${artifact.system} ${artifact.arch} nim`}
			>
				<span class="wyrd-download-mark" aria-hidden="true">{artifact.mark}</span>
				<span class="wyrd-download-name">
					<strong>{artifact.system}</strong>
					<small>{artifact.arch}</small>
				</span>
				<code>{artifact.target}</code>
				<span class="wyrd-download-kind">.{artifact.format} ↓</span>
			</a>
		))}
	</div>
	<footer class="wyrd-downloads__foot">
		<span>GitHub Actions timbreþ and fandaþ ælcne fremmere on his āgenre eorþan.</span>
		<nav aria-label="Frēolǣstunga">
			<a href={`${downloadBase}/SHA256SUMS`}>SHA-256 handfæstnys</a>
			<a href={releaseBase}>Ealle lǣstunga</a>
		</nav>
	</footer>
</section>
